+## HTTPS
+
+To serve the REST API, UI, and gRPC with TLS, configure a certificate and its private key:
+
+```yaml
+server:
+  protocol: https
+  https_port: 443
+  cert_file: /etc/flipt/tls/server.crt
+  cert_key: /etc/flipt/tls/server.key
+```
+
+Both files must exist before Flipt starts. The gRPC endpoint uses `server.grpc_port` with TLS in HTTPS mode. HTTP remains the default for existing configurations.
+
 ## Databases
 
 Flipt supports both [SQLite](https://www.sqlite.org/index.html) and [Postgres](https://www.postgresql.org/) databases as of `v0.5.0`.
